.TH LOU_CHECKYAML "1" "September 2026" "Liblouis 3.39.0" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lou_checkyaml \- A tool to check Braille tests defined in a YAML file
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lou_checkyaml
\fI\,YAML_TEST_FILE\/\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Run the tests defined in the YAML_TEST_FILE. Return 0 if all tests pass
or 1 if any of the tests fail. The details of failing tests are printed
to stderr.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
display this help and exit
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
display version information and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
report expected failures
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Written by Christian Egli.
